                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Clinical software is used in short, interrupted bursts between patients. The interface decisions below come from that constraint: show the critical information first, keep frequent actions reachable, and never hide the state of a record behind a click.",
